WEBVTT

00:00:00.116 --> 00:00:05.762
Discounts and scholarships

00:00:05.812 --> 00:00:14.265
Open Finance, then Discounts. It has three tabs: Discounts, Scholarships and Student Assignments.

00:00:17.485 --> 00:00:21.084
On the Discounts tab, press Add Discount.

00:00:22.875 --> 00:00:29.943
Enter the discount name. Choose the type, Percentage or Fixed Amount, and enter the value.

00:00:35.001 --> 00:00:44.174
In Applies To, choose all students, a grade level, a class, or siblings. You can also set dates and make it stackable.

00:00:44.640 --> 00:00:49.494
Press Create Discount. The new discount appears in the list.

00:00:52.451 --> 00:01:02.094
Scholarships work the same way, with Merit, Need, Sports or Staff Child types. Assign them to students from Fee Setup.

00:01:03.064 --> 00:01:07.734
Discount created
